BEHAVIOR bind

DESCRIPTION
  Server-side: binds socket to local address and port.
  Address format: sockaddr_in (16 bytes for IPv4).
  Bytes 0-1: family (2=AF_INET). Bytes 2-3: port (big-endian).
  Bytes 4-7: IP (0=any). Returns 0 on success.

CONTRACT
  INPUT fd int 8
  INPUT addr bytes 128
  INPUT addr_len int 8
  OUTPUT status int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 697435f5

NATIVE
